<title>POLAND: Rolimpex group net falls to PLN 22.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Rolimpex group net falls to PLN 22.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rolimpex group results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		    88.90   vs   83.84</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			44.37   vs   69.90</p>
<p>    net profit			    22.22   vs   47.59</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Rolimpex SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			  1,820.04   vs1,281.26</p>
<p>    costs of sales		   1,549.47   vs1,076.01</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.02   vs    0.20</p>
<p>    income tax			    20.67   vs   22.48</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.03   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  29.30   vs   30.45</p>
<p>    financial costs		     80.23   vs   49.47</p>
<p>    investment			   105.28   vs   44.91</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
